        "https://kbbi.kemdikbud.go.id/Content/Files/Petunjuk%20Pemakaian.PDF"
      ],
      "evidence_limitation": "No dedicated contrastive lexicographic source was located that explicitly labels these forms as non-false-friends."
    }
  ]
